# Credential language

A credential must include: issuer, learner, achievement, course version, issue date, expiry when applicable, supporting evidence reference, verification status, revocation status, and public verification identifier.

Public credential display is opt-in and reveals the minimum necessary data.

Forbidden marketing claims: accredited; nationally recognised; qualification; Statement of Attainment; guaranteed compliant; certified support worker.
